Also carries one migration entry that is not this commit's subject:

  20260909_1500_assistant_conversations  — the assistant's conversation and
                                           message tables, from the session
                                           building the tool-calling agent.

migrations.ts is an append-only file that two sessions were appending to at
once, and a path-scoped commit takes a whole file rather than a hunk, so the
entry rode along. It is complete and unmodified, and its author names it in
their own commit too so it is findable from both ends.

Worth knowing if you bisect a schema question to this commit: the entry above
touches ai_conversations / ai_messages and has nothing to do with the vector
store. It was also renamed from ...1200... to ...1500... before this was
pushed, so that array order and id order agree — db.ts applies migrations in
ARRAY order and records them by ID, and anyone inferring run order from the id
column would otherwise have inferred it backwards. No schema_migrations row for
the old id ever reached a pushed tree.
